{c: Verse 1}
[C#m]Kisi ki muskurahaton pe ho nisar
[C#m]Kisi ka dard mil [F#m]sake to le udhaar
[F#m]Kisi ke waaste ho [A]tere dil mein pyaar
[A]Jeena [B]isi ka [C#m]naam hai
[C#m]Maana apni jeb se fakeer hein
[C#m]Phir bhi [F#m]yaaron dil ke [C#m]ham ameer hein
[C#m]Mitte jo pyaar ke liye woh zindagi
[C#m]Chale bahaar ke [F#m]liye woh zindagi
[F#m]Kisi ko ho na [A]ho hamein to aitbaar
[A]Jeena [B]isi ka [C#m]naam hai
[C#m]Rishta dil se dil ke aitbaar ka
[C#m]Zinda hai [F#m]hami se [C#m]naam pyaar ka
[C#m]Ki marke bhi kisi ko yaad ayenge
[C#m]Kisi ke [F#m]aansuo mein muskuraanyenge
[F#m]Kahega phool har [A]kali se baar baar
[A]Jeena [B]isi ka [C#m]naam hai
